          %p First, an easy result on products of simplices.
          #product.num_lemma
            %h6#lemma_2 Lemma
            %p
              The realization of a product of two representables
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
