                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} R
              preserves colimits, and also products of representables by lemma
              = succeed "." do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#canonical"}
          %ul
            %li
              A slightly higher-level rendition of the proof might look like this:
